### CREATE - Create a new task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish REST API Assignment",
  "description": "Complete the backend project",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-20"
}

###

### READ ALL - Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

###

### READ ALL - Get completed tasks only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks?completed=true

###

### READ ONE - Get a task by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a7fcba121239ab47dfa0ee4

###

### UPDATE - Update a task
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a7fcba121239ab47dfa0ee4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST API Assignment Completed",
  "description": "Updated through PUT request",
  "isCompleted": true
}

###

### DELETE - Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a7fce3921239ab47dfa0ee6

###

### ERROR TEST - Task not found
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/000000000000000000000000

###

### VALIDATION TEST - Missing title
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This task has no title"
}